-- 685011 [KC] Tend the Falcon's Wounds: Falcons Are Friends: the falcon credits it on the Red Vial hit
-- 685021 [KC] Heal the Injured Friend: The Doctor Is In!: Lil Wa'zoo / Hi'bi Ja'min credit it on Loa's Brew
-- 685022 [KC] Chat with the Dying: Call of the Shadowlands: the dying NPC credits it from gossip
